724
00:26:49,000 --> 00:26:51,000
We'll have links to all of Mark's work

725
00:26:51,000 --> 00:26:54,000
and his website and the free resources that he mentioned.

726
00:26:54,000 --> 00:26:57,000
Mark, I really do appreciate you taking the time.

727
